%% Sequence Diagram — User books a room
%% End-to-end: validation, overlap check, persistence, metrics.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as Express Backend
    participant Auth as JWT Middleware
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Metric as prom-client

    User->>FE: Fill booking form & submit
    FE->>FE: Convert local datetime → ISO UTC
    FE->>API: POST /api/bookings<br/>{ roomId, startTime, endTime, purpose }

    API->>Auth: Verify Bearer JWT
    Auth-->>API: { id, role } or 401

    API->>API: Validate body (express-validator)
    alt Past date or end ≤ start
        API-->>FE: 400 — Invalid time range
    end

    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM rooms WHERE id = $1
    DB-->>API: room row
    alt Room status != 'available'
        API-->>FE: 400 — Room unavailable
    end

    API->>DB: SELECT 1 FROM bookings WHERE<br/>room_id = ? AND time overlaps
    DB-->>API: rowCount

    alt Overlap exists
        API-->>FE: 409 — Already booked
    else No overlap
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO bookings (status='pending')
        DB-->>API: new booking row
        API->>Metric: bookings_created_total.inc()
        API-->>FE: 201 Created · { booking }
        FE-->>User: Redirect to My Bookings<br/>(badge: pending)
    end
